                                "en": "The old man stood up from his chair <w>with difficulty</w>.",
                                "de": "Der alte Mann stand <w>mühsam</w> von seinem Stuhl auf."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "De onderhandelingen tussen de partijen verliepen erg <w>moeizaam</w>.",
